    "text": "Nie rozumiem zachwytu tym kebabem. Jeden z gorszych jakich jedliśmy. W kebabie mnóstwo cytryny, prosiliśmy bez sera a dostaliśmy z serem. Sosów praktycznie nie było. Bułka gorzka a mięso suche.\nJedliśmy w drugiej filii dwa lata temu i był tam sztos. Ten natomiast okropny.",
    "textTranslated": "I don't understand the enthusiasm for this kebab. It was one of the worst we've ever had. The kebab was chock-full of lemon; we asked for it without cheese, but it came with it. There was practically no sauce. The bun was bitter, and the meat was dry.\n\nWe ate at the other location two years ago, and it was fantastic. This one, however, was awful."
  },
